  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-beta.5 wrapping ZVec C++ 0.6.0. Native AOT / IL trimming compatible: typed ODM (IZvecCollection<T>, ZVecMapper, ZVecTypeModel) now uses [DynamicallyAccessedMembers] annotations. Consumer POCOs do not need annotations. Consumers can publish Native AOT with zero IL warnings. See CHANGELOG.",
